Z||000023||Archie||11-16-2000||09:46 PM||||Pretty good pictures Cliff, I wish I knew how to modify pics. like that. It sure would make planning new projects easier.<P>Pretty interesting that you picked Yellow. The pics. I rec'd. last nite from the current owner of the blue car prompted us to start planning the next chop top at the shop today & yellow was the color of choice.<P>The Lambo style door on the 2nd picture is real good editing. But I'm afraid that to make something like that (and make it work) would require a LOT of engineering.  However we do have some special plans for the next Chop Top.<P>I can't wait to show the guys at the shop these pics you've created.<P>As an exercize why don't you make this car Yellow for me and remove the wing. You can install any wheels you like.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-459s.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-464s.jpg">  <P>Thanks<P>Archie<p>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 11-16-2000).]||||reg||1
